  {
    "id": "dc371d5171ba45b4f9cd",
    "source": "A feature's bonus attack: 'martial arts' (weapon 'unarmed strike'), 'frenzy' or 'feature'. The server spends the bonus action. Martial arts is a monk's unarmed strike after taking the Attack action with an unarmed strike or monk weapon; frenzy is a raging Berserker's melee weapon attack; feature is a subclass's bonus weapon attack (Battle Magic or War Magic after casting with the action, Sudden Strike or Curving Shot after attacking, Telekinetic Master while concentrating on telekinesis) or a feat's (Great Weapon Master after a melee crit or kill, Polearm Master's butt-end strike after an Attack action with a polearm (1d4 bludgeoning), Crossbow Expert's hand crossbow shot after an Attack action with a one-handed weapon, Charger's melee attack after a Dash). The server checks the feature and the turn.",
